operational_runbook:
- How to re-run normalizer for a specific envelope: call /v1/normalize/reprocess?envelope={id}
- How to revoke a manifest: mark manifest.status=revoked and create a revocation-envelope signed by security key; update evidence-index-v2 alias.
- Alerting: monitor evidence-normalizer-error-rate > 1% and signer-latency p95 > 500ms.
